              "type": "text",
              "content": "```\n[VIDEO: Module 1 – Emotional Messaging Frameworks (Duration: 12:41)]\n```\n\n------"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551836022-d5d88e9218df?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
                "alt": "Psychology and emotions",
                "caption": "Understanding emotional triggers in marketing",
                "alignment": "center"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### Transcript\n\n### **The Mind Responds to Emotion, Not Logic**\n\nPeople buy emotionally and justify logically afterwards.\n Your job as a marketer is to speak directly to the **emotion active in the buyer's mind at that moment**.\n\n### **The 4 Buying Emotions**\n\n1. **Desire** – wanting transformation\n2. **Relief** – wanting a pain to end\n3. **Fear** – avoiding mistakes or loss\n4. **Belonging** – wanting to be part of something\n\nThese four emotions drive most purchases online.\n\n------"
            }
          ],
          "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
        },
