              "type": "text",
              "content": "### Example\n\n- **Emotion:** \"Frustrated with ads that don't convert?\"\n- **Proof:** \"Brands using this framework increase ROAS by 30–40%.\"\n- **Payoff:** \"Spend less, earn more.\""
