              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### Transcript\n\n### **The 3-Part Conversion Script**\n\nAll high-performing ads follow this structure:\n\n1. **Pattern interrupt**\n2. **Emotional tension**\n3. **Solution demonstration**\n\n### Why it works\n\nThe brain is optimized to ignore 99% of what it sees.\n A pattern interrupt forces attention.\n Emotional tension creates interest.\n The solution creates desire.\n\n------"
            }
          ],
          "video_url": "https://example.com/video.mp4"
        },
        {
          "name": "Cold Traffic Script Template",
          "description": "Template for cold traffic ad scripts",
          "type": "dynamic",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "# Cold Traffic Script Template\n\n```\n1. Hook (Pattern interrupt)  \n2. Problem + emotional tension  \n3. Show the solution  \n4. Add social proof  \n5. CTA  \n```"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout_warning",
              "content": "**Common Mistake:** Don't skip the emotional tension. If you jump straight to the solution, cold audiences won't care."
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611224923853-80b023f02d71?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
                "alt": "Creative writing and copywriting",
                "caption": "Master the art of persuasive copywriting",
                "alignment": "center"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code_block",
              "content": {
                "code": "function createAdScript(hook, problem, solution, proof, cta) {\n  return `${hook}\\n\\n${problem}\\n\\n${solution}\\n\\n${proof}\\n\\n${cta}`;\n}\n\n// Example usage\nconst script = createAdScript(\n  'Your ads are failing for one reason...',\n  'People scroll because they feel nothing.',\n  'Here's a framework that maps emotion to buying stages.',\n  'Used by 4800+ marketers this year alone.',\n  'Download the script blueprint.'\n);",
                "language": "javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### Example Script\n\n**Hook:** \"Your ads are failing for one reason nobody talks about.\"\n **Tension:** \"People scroll not because your product is bad… but because they feel nothing.\"\n **Solution:** \"Here's a framework that maps emotion to buying stages…\"\n **Social Proof:** \"Used by 4800+ marketers this year alone.\"\n **CTA:** \"Download the script blueprint.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "scenarios",
              "content": {
