        {
          "name": "The \"Moment of Change\" Story Formula",
          "description": "The four-part story structure",
          "type": "dynamic",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "# The \"Moment of Change\" Story Formula\n\nEvery great story has four simple parts:\n\n1. **Before State** – the struggle\n2. **Trigger Moment** – the shift\n3. **New Possibility** – the idea\n4. **After State** – the transformation"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
                "alt": "Story structure diagram",
                "caption": "The four-part story structure",
                "alignment": "center"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### Example\n\n- **Before:** \"Your ads are dead.\"\n- **Trigger:** \"You realize the problem isn't the targeting—it's the story.\"\n- **New Possibility:** \"You try an emotional messaging system.\"\n- **After:** \"ROAS rises and becomes predictable.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "content": {
                "headers": ["Aspect", "Feature", "Story"],
                "rows": [
                  ["Focus", "What the product *is*", "What the product *does* for the user"],
                  ["Brain Activation", "Logic center (Broca's area)", "Emotion & Sensory centers"],
                  ["Retention", "Low", "High"],
                  ["Connection", "Transactional", "Relational"]
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "flipcard",
              "content": {
                "front": "Before State",
                "back": "The struggle your audience faces before finding your solution."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
