          "type": "dynamic",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "# NEPQ Question Types & Examples\n\n### **1. Problem Awareness**\n\n- \"What part of ad creation do you struggle with most?\"\n- \"What always makes your ads perform poorly?\""
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "content": {
                "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
                "alt": "Brain thinking and problem solving",
                "caption": "Understanding customer psychology through questions",
                "alignment": "center"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### **2. Consequence Questions**\n\n- \"What happens if this problem continues?\"\n- \"How much budget is being wasted each month?\""
            },
            {
              "type": "math_equation",
              "content": {
                "equation": "ROAS = \\frac{Revenue}{Ad Spend}",
                "display": "block"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### **3. Solution Awareness**\n\n- \"What would the ideal ad creation system look like?\"\n- \"How would it change your business if ads finally worked?\""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "### **4. Commitment Questions**\n\n- \"If you found a system that fixed this, would you test it this week?\""
            },
